 ### 4.3 Bosses, minions, and encounter composition
 
 Use “boss” and “minion” as encounter jobs, not hidden statistical exceptions.
@@ -335,6 +412,46 @@
 targets they can remove. Do not invent one-hit minion behavior: neither licensed
